# 5. Biggest Difference — C++ vs Java vs Python

| Feature              | C++               | Java                     | Python                   |
| -------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------ |
| Built-in Multi-Set   | ✅ `multiset`      | ❌ No standard `Multiset` | ❌ No direct built-in     |
| Common solution      | `multiset`        | `TreeMap`                | `Counter`                |
| Stores duplicates    | ✅                 | ✅                        | ✅                        |
| Frequency available  | `count()`         | Map value                | `Counter[element]`       |
| Automatically sorted | ✅                 | ✅ `TreeMap`              | ❌                        |
| Insert               | `insert()`        | `put()`                  | `update()`               |
| Find                 | `find()`          | `containsKey()`          | `in`                     |
| Remove one           | `erase(iterator)` | decrement count          | `subtract()` / decrement |
| Remove all           | `erase(value)`    | remove key               | delete/decrement         |
| Main structure       | Tree              | TreeMap                  | Hash-map-like Counter    |

