## 1. C++ Multi-Set

C++ provides a **direct `multiset` container**.

```cpp
multiset<int> ms;

ms.insert(5);
ms.insert(2);
ms.insert(5);
ms.insert(2);
```

Result:

```text
{2, 2, 5, 5}
```

### Important

```cpp
ms.count(5);
```

→ gives number of `5`s.

```cpp
ms.erase(5);
```

→ removes **all `5`s**.

```cpp
ms.erase(ms.find(5));
```

→ removes **only one `5`**.

